<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">{{ listings.food.entries.length }} kitchens, coffeehouses and food shops across the two blocks &#8212; Italian, Mexican, Japanese, Chinese, pizza, a brewery, a bar with its own kitchen, and an independent grocery with a deli counter at the back. Most of it is independent, and several have patios.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">Beyond the food there are galleries, gift shops, makers, wellness practices and the everyday trades, all in the same short walk. The full directory lists {{ listings.entries.length }} businesses by category and says when each row was last checked.</p>
