<section class="n-bg-paper" id="art" aria-labelledby="e4-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-block:clamp(28px,3.5vw,60px)">
<div class="n-entry n-entry--flip">
<span class="n-num" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem + 1.6vw,3.25rem)">04</span>
<div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="e4-h" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem + 1.4vw,2.75rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">See the public art</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">The steel gateway sculpture stands at the highway edge of the community, an oval sign held inside two curving rails. Further works are sited around the commercial blocks, close enough to see on the same walk.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">The Niwot Sculpture Park, run by the Niwot Cultural Arts Association since 2018, shows sculptures the association has bought or been given alongside pieces lent by artists for a year at a time, chosen by the park&#8217;s committee. The association&#8217;s site lists the current pieces.</p>
<dl style="margin:22px 0 0">
<div class="n-fact" style="border-top-color:rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Sculpture park</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem"><a class="n-link" href="https://niwotarts.org/" rel="noopener">Niwot Cultural Arts Association <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></dd>
</div>
<div class="n-fact" style="border-top-color:rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Best for</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">A slow loop of the blocks, and the September art walk.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch">Individual works are named here only with a verified title, artist and location. <a href="/contact/">Send one</a> and it goes in with artist credit.</p>
</div>
