<span class="n-num" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem + 1.6vw,3.25rem)">06</span>
<div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="e6-h" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem + 1.4vw,2.75rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Come back for what&#8217;s on</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">Niwot runs {{ annualEvents.length }} events every year, and most of them are free: free concerts on the park lawn on summer Thursdays, dancing on the square on Friday evenings, an art walk on second Fridays, a Halloween party on Second Avenue, and a tree lighting and a parade over Thanksgiving weekend.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">A date appears on this site only once it has been read on the organizer&#8217;s own page, so the calendar is short in the spring and long by the summer. The annual guide describes each series whether or not this year&#8217;s date exists yet.</p>
<dl style="margin:22px 0 0">
<div class="n-fact" style="border-top-color:rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">The big one</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">Rock &amp; Rails, Thursday evenings from June to August, on the lawn beside the caboose.</dd>
</div>
<div class="n-fact" style="border-top-color:rgba(36,72,58,.22)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet">Best for</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">A summer evening; the Saturday before Halloween; the day after Thanksgiving.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:20px">
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/annual-events/">Events &amp; festivals</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/events/rock-and-rails/">Rock &amp; Rails</a>
</div>
